  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Yayoi Kusama, Japanese artist who became a global superstar, dies aged 97",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/artanddesign/2026/aug/27/yayoi-kusama-dies-aged-97-artist-dead",
      "description": "<p>From the 1950s to the 2020s, Kusama produced vivid paintings, sculptures and vast installations that often drew on her experience of hallucinations</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/artanddesign/gallery/2026/aug/27/yayoi-kusama-gallery-life-in-pictures\">Kusama – a life in pictures</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/artanddesign/2018/sep/23/yayoi-kusama-infinity-film-victoria-miro-exhibition\">Was Kusama the world’s favourite artist?</a></p></li></ul><p>Yayoi Kusama, the Japanese outsider artist who reached superstar status after decades living in a psychiatric hospital, has died aged 97.</p><p>Kusama died in a Tokyo hospital on 14 August, her company Yayoi Kusama Inc announced <a href=\"https://yayoi-kusama.jp/en/news4518/\">in a statement</a> on Thursday.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/artanddesign/2026/aug/27/yayoi-kusama-dies-aged-97-artist-dead\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-08-27T02:17:59"
    },
    {
      "title": "In Japan, Yayoi Kusama Is Remembered as a Visionary and a Rebel",
      "link": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/27/world/asia/yayoi-kusama-japan-artist.html",
      "description": "Artists, scholars and fans celebrated Ms. Kusama as a cultural giant who helped bring Japanese art to the masses.",
      "source_name": "NYT World News",
      "published": "2026-08-27T11:06:16"
    },
    {
      "title": "Yayoi Kusama Was the Avant-Garde Radical Who Became a Pop Icon",
      "link": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/26/arts/design/yayoi-kusama-appraisal.html",
      "description": "In her mass-produced ubiquity, Kusama became one of her own dots, spreading her image into every corner of our culture.",
      "source_name": "NYT World News",
      "published": "2026-08-27T10:03:23"
    },
    {
      "title": "Yayoi Kusama, Japanese Pop Artist Known for Polka-Dot Paintings, Dies at 97",
      "link": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/26/arts/yayoi-kusama-dead.html",
      "description": "The Japanese artist’s polka-dot-covered paintings, phallic sculptures and public performances caused a stir in New York City and Europe in the 1960s.",
      "source_name": "NYT World News",
      "published": "2026-08-27T16:30:50"
    },
    {
      "title": "Yayoi Kusama, Japanese artist who painted polka dots, dies at 97",
